<p data-start="649" data-end="723">⚠️ <strong data-start="652" data-end="695">No cambies <code data-start="665" data-end="677">index.html</code> ni <code data-start="681" data-end="692">codigo.gs</code>.</strong> Solo reemplazamos <code data-start="714" data-end="722">app.js</code>.</p>
